Rama wakes and bathes in lotus-scented water --- Rama worships fire gods and rising sun --- Rama seeks leave to tour Dandaka hermitages --- Sutikshna blesses safe road with shadow-like Sita --- Sage praises fruit-rich calm-beast hermitage ring --- Sage bids return after seeing hermitages --- Rama circumambulates sage and sets out --- Sita gives brothers quivers bows bright swords